<th id="6">デイノニクス</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/exhibition012.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/exhibition012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/dino/capq/8_exhibition/img/exhibition012.jpg" --></a><a href="img/exhibition013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/exhibition013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/dino/capq/8_exhibition/img/exhibition013.jpg" --></a></td>
